  "setup": "NEEDS: 4x RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell 96 GB (sm_120) in one machine, power limit 300 W each (decode at C8 and above and prefill sit at the cap). Host RAM: about 20 GB MemAvailable drop, rounded up. Weights about 204 GB on local NVMe; a writable /cache volume holds the JIT kernels (first start compiles them). Docker: --ipc=host --shm-size 32g --ulimit memlock=-1 --ulimit stack=67108864. IMPORTANT: this was validated on Karmic Kraken plus the one-file fix in data/sources/glm-5.3-flash-kk (OnlineMoEMethodBase.apply must accept and forward workspace, needed for MXFP8 shared and MTP experts). The pinned base image alone crashes at first forward until an attested build carrying that fix replaces the image digest here."
